since Alpha 0.0.71 HF1. The highlights Equipment stat regression fixed: older gear uses its original stat-roll rules again, while newly generated gear uses the corrected pool. Controller & Steam Deck improvements: initial controller support across gameplay and core menus, with","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T03:28:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041139","verified_at":"2026-10-25T08:33:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4189120-1847286114039039","game_id":"steam-4189120","kind":"announcement","title":"Alpha 0.0.71 — Bigger Stashes, New Tricks & Dungeon Updates","summary":"Alpha 0.0.71 brings more room for your loot, new ways to ride, and a long list of improvements across Debauchery & Magic. Here’s what’s changing since Alpha 0.0.70. The highlights Double the stash: 80 slots per character, up from 40. Inspect your gear: rotate supported items in 3D and read their stats, abilities and effects. Start your fish collection: discover 36 species and track your smallest and largest catches across characters. Take skating further: wall slides, more grindable world edges,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T07:21:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114039039","verified_at":"2026-10-24T10:51:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4189120-1847286114027529","game_id":"steam-4189120","kind":"announcement","title":"Alpha 0.0.70 - Kickflip a horse","summary":"Alpha 0.0.70 Update NotesInventory, Equipment and ShopsItem pickups: Added pickup improvements.Inventory controls: Added Ctrl-click multiselection and right-click bulk drop/delete, including while a chest is open.Inventory sorting: Added a Sort button.Stowing items: Selecting the held hotbar slot again now puts the item away without removing its assignment.Equipment comparison: Tooltips now compare equipped gear against items, with colored stat gains and losses.Shop selling: Added Sell All for a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T04:48:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027529","verified_at":"2026-10-21T11:55:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4189120-1846651706675896","game_id":"steam-4189120","kind":"announcement","title":"NextFest Developer Stream!","summary":"Next Fest is here!Join Squid Gumbo and the community as we head into Debauchery & Magic for NextFest and play through portions of the demo! Swing by the 3rd Shift Studios Twitch channel and hang out as we fight goblins, complete ridiculous quests, and get up to all sorts of nonsense.What's the deal??During our community playtests and streamed showcases, you can expect:Questing!Fishing!Gambling??Drinking some tasty brewsInhaling unknowable substances...Fighting Goblins!!Seriously though, you shou","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T23:46:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706675896","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4189120":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:45Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:44Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4189120":"2026-10-26T11:44:45Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4189120":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:44Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:44Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:44Z"},"4221300":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:4